<title>AUSTRALIA: Freedom says m.d. Pinshaw to leave group.</title>
<headline>Freedom says m.d. Pinshaw to leave group.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Freedom Furniture Ltd said on Tuesday its managing director Jonathan Pinshaw plans to leave the company to pursue challenges outside the group.</p>
<p>Freedom said it would look for new managing director, but Pinshaw would stay with the company until his contract expires on February 6, 1998. The furniture retailer listed on the stock exchange on July 25, 1996. At 2.05 p.m. (0405 GMT), Freedom shares were five cents up at A$2.35.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
